# Mutation table for the organize HTTP handler's use of the Landing contract
# (PR #3051). Lives apart from organize-landing.muts because mutation-matrix.sh
# runs ONE package per table and this file's tests are in handlers, not organizer.
#
# Format: NAME | FILE | PERL_EXPRESSION      (see scripts/mutation-matrix.sh)
# Run:
#   scripts/mutation-matrix.sh \
#     --pkg ./internal/server/handlers/ \
#     --table scripts/mutation-tables/organize-landing-handler.muts

# The in-place / new-version decision arrives on Landing.InPlace; inverting it
# mints a second book row for a file that moved in place (the #3046 M2 hole).
M17 handler-inverts-inplace | internal/server/handlers/organize.go | s/if landing\.InPlace \{/if !landing.InPlace {/
